The icons in this directory that are not custom drawn for this program
come from the Faenza icon set, which can be found at
http://gnome-look.org/content/show.php/Faenza?content=128143, and is
available under GPL.

fonts/ has Courier Prime, the screen and PDF font, from
https://github.com/quoteunquoteapps/CourierPrime (as packaged in
https://github.com/google/fonts), available under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt).
